WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.810
In Selection, Rhodo recommends past projects from your firm’s records,

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.430
each with the experience that supports it.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.910
Then it recommends the people whose qualifications

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.430
fit each role.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:14.570
Accept the team, or compare an alternative.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.850
Those choices build your experience matrix,

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.470
connecting people to the projects they delivered.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.630
Approve it, and the selection moves forward.
